OOPs

Polymorphism[Many+forms]
  -Method overloading: In a class we can have two or more methods with same name provided
                       their signatures are different

                       accessModifier returnType methodName(parameters)
                       {
                       }

                       How to make signatures different:
                          -by increasing the count of parameters
                          -by changing the data type of parameters
                          -by changing the order of parameters

                       Method overloading is also known as Compile time Polymorphism

                       Method overloading happens within the same class

                       => Can we overload the main method
  -Method overriding